    "q-125048": {
      "dom_id": "step-q125048",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r,$ where $F(x,y)=2{x}^{7}\\,i+{5}^{x+y}\\,j$ and $C$ is the line segment traversed from the point $A(2,3)$ to the point $B(5,4)?$\n\n*Hint: Use the parametrization $r(t)=(2+3t)\\,i+(3+t)\\,j.$*",
      "worked_solution": "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{a}^{b}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nFirst, we need to parameterize the line segment.\nThe position vectors of the endpoints of our line segment are \n$a=2\\,i+3\\,j$ and $b=5\\,i+4\\,j.$\nSo, the parametrization of the line segment is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(t) & =a+t(b-a) \\\\  & =(2\\,i+3\\,j)+t[(5\\,i+4\\,j)-(2\\,i+3\\,j)] \\\\  & =(2\\,i+3\\,j)+t(3\\,i+j) \\\\  & =(2+3t)\\,i+(3+t)\\,j,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $t$ varies from $t=0$ (at the point $A$) to $t=1$ (at the point $B$).\nThus, along the curve $C,$ we have\n\n$$\nx=2+3t,\\,y=3+t.\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(t)) & =2{x}^{7}\\,i+{5}^{x+y}\\,j \\\\  & =2(2+3t)^{7}\\,i+{5}^{2+3t+3+t}\\,j \\\\  & =2(2+3t)^{7}\\,i+{5}^{5+4t}\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing ${r}^{′}(t),$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2+3t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3+t)j \\\\  & =3\\,i+j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t) & =(2(2+3t)^{7}\\,i+{5}^{5+4t}\\,j)\\cdot (3\\,i+j) \\\\  & =2(2+3t)^{7}\\cdot 3+{5}^{5+4t}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =6(2+3t)^{7}+{5}^{5+4t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can write the integral as \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}F(r(t))\\cdot {r}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}6(2+3t)^{7}+{5}^{5+4t}\\,dt.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-125048-a",
